# Cloudflare DNS-01 for acme-companion (all bastion edge FQDNs:
# portal + subdomain_proxy + public_proxy + infra).
# Copy to .env.acme at the compose root (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Gate: zone ar-systems.fr must be on Cloudflare + token Zone.DNS Edit
# before first real issue (confirm "CF DNS OK"). See docs/lets-encrypt-acme-nginx-bastion.md.
# https://github.com/acmesh-official/acme.sh/wiki/dnsapi#dns_cf

# CF_Token=...
# CF_Account_ID=...
# CF_Zone_ID=...   # optional but faster

# Optional overrides (also settable in compose environment / Admin → ACME):
# ACME_DNS_API=dns_cf
# ACME_CA=letsencrypt_test   # staging first — 1 FQDN per family, then:
# ACME_CA=letsencrypt        # production
# ACME_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=ops@example.fr   # register-account (LE); sinon acme@PORTAL_DOMAIN
